# 28. Historical vs Prospective Sources

The project must maintain a strict distinction between historical research and prospective validation.

## Historical Research

Used to estimate models:

```text
historical market data
historical macro data
historical event data
```

## Prospective Validation

Used after model development:

```text
live/near-live market observations
model prediction logs
thinkorswim
paperMoney
```

Prospective observations should not later be inserted into the original training dataset without creating a clearly defined new model version.

