# 33. Next Decision

Before building `src/data/collect.py`, the project must answer:

> What source will provide the historical intraday market dataset used to estimate the initial model?

The immediate source-validation sequence should be:

```text
1. Test Schwab historical TMF data
          ↓
2. Test Schwab historical TLT data
          ↓
3. Test Schwab Treasury futures data
          ↓
4. Measure available historical depth
          ↓
5. Determine whether another historical provider is required
          ↓
6. Freeze Version 1 source architecture
          ↓
